        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After applying the filter, click on the Submit button."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match for the submit action following filter application."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, check if the option to submit is set to \"false\"."
      ],
      "justification": "Check action and XOR branch preserve the decision point triggered by evaluating the submit option."
    },
    {
